# Ask. Then lock it.

If something feels missing, two readings are possible, or a default would decide **money, orders, flatten, Arm, belt, TF, or what counts as a live strategy** — **stop and ask**. Do not fill the gap with a guess, a leftover from another chat, or “probably what they meant.”

After they answer: treat it as standing until they change it. Write it down (rule / chat) if it will matter next session.

Do not invent Match%, letters, Arm state, or fills you did not see. Visitor Cloud DISARMED is not the operator’s Arm.

Purgatory / incubation never belongs in Room 3 match, display, or fire. If that is about to leak, ask is already too late — block it.

Wrong: “Arm was off (I scraped DISARMED).” Right: “Your tab or mine — which Arm am I using?”
Wrong: trade off-belt leftovers because maps existed. Right: “Belt-only, or are leftover piles allowed to enter?”
